\end{figure}

In Section \ref{sec:polytope-boundary}, we will need to consider graphs where each half-edge has an orientation; these are called \emph{bidirected graphs}, and were introduced in \cite{EJ70}. We will only use the terminology related to these objects, rather than any specific result.


